  "ruleText": "Puc 402.16 \"Rural telephone company (RTC)\" means an ILEC meeting the definition of rural telephone company under 47 U.S.C. § 153(44).\n\nSource. (See Revision Note # 1, Revision Note #2, and Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Puc 400) #14029, eff 7-25-24",
